31
00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:21.840
I'll share it with everyone.
我会分享给大家。

32
00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:22.800
I'm huge into making my bed.
我非常热衷于铺床。

33
00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:23.680
He's delightful.
他太可爱了。

34
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.360
So first of all, I would always sort of pull the comforter all the way up and then
首先，我以前总是把被子直接拉到头，然后

